From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zrmnelson <104142635+zrmnelson@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:05:23 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 10/17] qt: recent media without the media library, 3 s control
 auto-hide, Omarchy overlay palette

RecentMediaList keeps the last ten played media in the interface settings (VLC 4's own
list needs the media library) and the empty home screen shows it; titles are escaped
because file names are untrusted. mouse_hide_timeout makes the control/cursor auto-hide
delay a build option (3 s here, stock 1 s). VLCStyle's dark palette, used for the
controls over video, follows the Omarchy theme: the full dark palette for a dark theme,
dark neutrals with the theme accent for a light one.
